t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"far fa-handshake\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Apply to Join Club<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db4aa76 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"db4aa76\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-371d02e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"371d02e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 data-path-to-node=\"1\">\ud83d\udcdc Transfer Market Regulations<\/h5><p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Welcome to the official Transfer Hub. To maintain competitive integrity across the league, all players and managers must strictly adhere to the following transfer policies:<\/p><ul data-path-to-node=\"3\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Off-Season Window Only:<\/b> The transfer window strictly opens <b data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">only<\/b> after a league or season has officially concluded.<\/p><\/li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Active Season Roster Lock:<\/b> There are absolutely no active transfers or roster changes permitted while a league is currently in progress. Once a season kicks off, all players are firmly locked to their respective clubs.<\/p><\/li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application Process:<\/b> When the transfer window is officially open, use the application form to submit your request directly to a club manager.<\/p><\/li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Anti-Double Contract:<\/b> You are permitted to apply to multiple clubs simultaneously. However, as soon as one manager approves your request, your transfer is finalized, and all other pending applications will be automatically voided by the system.<\/p><\/li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Manager Discretion:<\/b> Submitting a request does not guarantee a roster spot. All roster moves are subject to final review and approval by the receiving club&#8217;s manager.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-895153913\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-895153913\" data-tab-index=\"3\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 3;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-00cebfd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"00cebfd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a48f42 e-con-full hanya-player e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2a48f42\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-291fa30 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"291fa30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 data-path-to-node=\"1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">\u26a0\ufe0f WARNING: MANAGER STATUS CLAIM<\/b><\/h5><p data-path-to-node=\"1,0\">By proceeding, you will be granted administrative rights and responsibilities as a Club Manager within the IWVPL system.<\/p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,1\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Important Notes:<\/b><\/p><ul data-path-to-node=\"1,2\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\">Players who serve as Club Managers are <b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">NOT ELIGIBLE FOR TRANSFERS<\/b> and cannot move to another club during the transfer window.<\/p><\/li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,0\">If you wish to revoke your Manager status or change clubs in the future, you <b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">must contact an Admin via a Discord ticket<\/b>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-path-to-node=\"1,3\"><i data-path-to-node=\"1,3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">To prevent accidental clicks, please type the word <b data-path-to-node=\"1,3\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">MANAGER<\/b> in the field below to confirm your decision.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-937ee3d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form\" data-id=\"937ee3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;40&quot;,&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;Previous&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"form.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<form class=\"elementor-form\" method=\"post\" name=\"Become Manager\" aria-label=\"Become Manager\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"post_id\" value=\"4881\"\/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"937ee3d\"\/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referer_title\" value=\"\" \/>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-form-fields-wrapper elementor-labels-above\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-text elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-confirm_word elementor-col-30 elementor-field-required eleme